# ================================================================
# FILE MAU cau hinh gui email OTP - AN TOAN de commit len Git (khong
# chua thong tin that). Khi clone project qua may khac, COPY file nay
# thanh "mail-secrets.properties" (bo duoi .example) roi dien thong tin
# that cua ban vao.
# ================================================================
#
# HUONG DAN LAY APP PASSWORD GMAIL (KHONG dung mat khau Gmail thuong,
# Google se tu choi vi ly do bao mat neu dung mat khau thuong):
#   1. Bat "Xac minh 2 buoc" (2-Step Verification) cho tai khoan Gmail
#      tai: https://myaccount.google.com/security
#   2. Vao: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
#      Tao 1 App Password moi (chon ung dung "Mail", thiet bi tuy chon
#      "Khac" va dat ten vd "Baitap02-OTP").
#   3. Google se hien 1 ma gom 16 ky tu (dang "xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx") -
#      copy ma nay (bo dau cach) dan vao dong mail.password ben duoi.
#
# Neu de trong 2 dong mail.username/mail.password, he thong se TU DONG
# chuyen sang CHE DO DEMO: OTP duoc in ra console log cua Tomcat thay vi
# gui email that - van demo duoc day du luong nghiep vu (dang ky, quen
# mat khau) trong khi chua kip tao App Password that.

mail.smtp.host=smtp.gmail.com
mail.smtp.port=587
mail.username=your-email@gmail.com
mail.password=your-16-char-app-password
